# Campunex Web Frontend Environment Variables

# Backend API base URL (in production: https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1 or https://campunex-server.onrender.com/api/v1)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# Backend Socket.IO WebSocket URL (in production: https://api.yourdomain.com or https://campunex-server.onrender.com)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:4000
